  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through MEANINGFUL WORK in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MEANINGFUL WORK   will empower youth (age 13-30), including youth with disabilities and internally displaced youth,  to secure financial stability through trainings on saving and investment and business development. Knowledge and skills acquired will enable youth to initiate business ventures, supported by small social enterprises, thereby responding to high unemployment rates in South Sudan. Youth use knowledge to challenge traditional attitudes and political structures to improve management of natural resources.</narrative>
  </description>
